      'You\'re managing a $500,000 portfolio for a couple nearing retirement. The market has just dropped 35% in 6 weeks (similar to March 2020). Your portfolio is now worth $325,000. The couple is panicking and calling you daily. Apply Prospect Theory insights to guide your decisions.',
