      'Design a Choice Architecture System for a New Employee Benefits Platform',
      'You\'ve been hired as the choice architect for a Fortune 500 company redesigning its employee benefits platform. The current system has opt-in enrollment with 42% participation, a $1,500 employer match that 58% of employees leave uncaptured, and an average contribution rate of 3.2%. Your goal: maximize retirement readiness using only nudge principles (no mandates).',
