        { term: 'Newspaper Test', definition: 'A thought experiment: if tomorrow\'s newspaper headline is negative about your investment, would you still hold? Tests whether conviction is based on durable data or fragile narrative.', example: 'If "CEO resigns unexpectedly" would cause you to panic sell, your thesis was built on the CEO narrative, not the company\'s fundamentals.' }
